<title>USA: Puerto Rican Cement Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Puerto Rican Cement Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>CONSOLIDATED STATEMENT OF INCOME</p>
<p>				  (UNAUDITED)</p>
<p>				    (In Thousands, except share data)</p>
<p>						    Three months ended,</p>
<p>							    MARCH 31,</p>
<p>							1997	    1996</p>
